## Domain 5: Configuration and Knowledge Management (12%)

### Question 5.1 · Advanced · Multiple choice · select ONE

In a proposals Project, Claude keeps quoting prices. The rule "never quote prices; refer to
the account manager" sits on page 12 of a style guide uploaded as knowledge. What is the
fix?

**A.** Move the rule into the Project's custom instructions.

**B.** Re-upload the style guide with the rule highlighted in bold.

