A pricing sheet in Google Drive changes weekly; the team's Project holds a copy uploaded in
January. Policy permits the Drive connector for this file. How should stale quotes be fixed?

**A.** Re-upload the latest pricing sheet to the Project every Monday.

**B.** Add an instruction telling Claude to flag that prices may be outdated.

