**D.** "Write as our head of communications would write to staff."

### Question 5.4 · Expert · Multiple choice · select ONE

A Project's knowledge holds 40 documents, including the 2023, 2024 and 2026 editions of the
employee handbook. Answers mix rules from different editions. What is the best fix?

